{"id":"cbb11883655db5cd","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-gl-arithmetical.md","title":"GL Arithmetical Interpretation","display":"df-gl-arithmetical — GL Arithmetical Interpretation","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-gl-arithmetical","aliases":["89-df-gl-arithmetical"],"display":"df-gl-arithmetical — GL Arithmetical Interpretation","depends_on":["[[89-df-arithmetical-realization]]","[[89-df-gl-logic]]","[[89-df-provable-formula]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-gl-arithmetical"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-gl-arithmetical</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-gl-arithmetical — GL Arithmetical Interpretation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1f581262c09d5e34\" href=\"?note=1f581262c09d5e34\" title=\"89-df-arithmetical-realization\">89-df-arithmetical-realization</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0006800fa1c85177\" href=\"?note=0006800fa1c85177\" title=\"89-df-gl-logic\">89-df-gl-logic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2d52ad4f119b4a14\" href=\"?note=2d52ad4f119b4a14\" title=\"89-df-provable-formula\">89-df-provable-formula</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{T}\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{T}\\)</span> is a recursively axiomatized arithmetical theory.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Real}(T)\">\\(\\mathrm{Real}(T)\\)</span> is the set of arithmetical realizations.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GL}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(\\mathrm{GL}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span> is the Gödel--Löb logic.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ProvFml}(T)\">\\(\\mathrm{ProvFml}(T)\\)</span> is the set of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span>-provable sentences.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gl\\text{-}arithmetical}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{GLAr}(T)\n\\coloneqq\n\\{\\tau\\in\\mathrm{Real}(T)\\mid\n\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{GL}\\;\n\\tau(A)\\in\\mathrm{ProvFml}(T)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gl\\text{-}arithmetical}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{GLAr}(T)\n\\coloneqq\n\\{\\tau\\in\\mathrm{Real}(T)\\mid\n\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{GL}\\;\n\\tau(A)\\in\\mathrm{ProvFml}(T)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Real}(T)\">\\(\\mathrm{Real}(T)\\)</span> 已保证 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span> 是结构递归的证明性解释，因此这里不再\n重复一个与成员条件等价的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PrInt}_{T}(\\tau)\">\\(\\mathrm{PrInt}_{T}(\\tau)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>新增的条件表达真正的 GL 算术可靠性：每个 GL 定理的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span>-翻译都在\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 中可证。</li>\n<li>在适当的推导条件下，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GLAr}(T)=\\mathrm{Real}(T)\">\\(\\mathrm{GLAr}(T)=\\mathrm{Real}(T)\\)</span> 是需要证明的结论，\n不是本定义中的循环预设。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-arithmetical-realization","status":"resolved","id":"1f581262c09d5e34","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-arithmetical-realization]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-gl-logic","status":"resolved","id":"0006800fa1c85177","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-logic]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-provable-formula","status":"resolved","id":"2d52ad4f119b4a14","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-provable-formula]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{T}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Real}(T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GL}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ProvFml}(T)","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gl\\text{-}arithmetical}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{GLAr}(T)\n\\coloneqq\n\\{\\tau\\in\\mathrm{Real}(T)\\mid\n\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{GL}\\;\n\\tau(A)\\in\\mathrm{ProvFml}(T)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Real}(T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PrInt}_{T}(\\tau)","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GLAr}(T)=\\mathrm{Real}(T)","display":false}],"bytes":1276,"backlinks":[{"id":"7ed22bf7259dd6b3","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-228","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-arithmetical]]"}],"outgoing":["1f581262c09d5e34","0006800fa1c85177","2d52ad4f119b4a14"]}